# Build context is the repo root, but the Dockerfile only COPYs ui/, server/src/ and
# migrations/. Keep everything else out — notably ./data (the dev Postgres directory, not
# even readable by the build user) and any .env with real secrets.
*
!ui/
!server/src/
!migrations/

# Local build outputs and dependencies, rebuilt inside the image.
**/node_modules
**/bin
**/obj
ui/dist
ui/.angular
server/src/Lodge.Server/wwwroot
